Establish Kitchen Terminal K7's foundational constraints, concepts, and decisions as always-live shared knowledge
---
[node:0bc7e618-9b95-4977-9fe1-f3a48759276f]
type: constraint
tier: mid-term
path: /artifact/safari-15-0-is-the-hard-compile-target-f
created_at: 2026-09-08T09:36:58.919859+00:00
needs_review: false
retrieval_weight: 1.0
trust_weight: 1.0
archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:8a6a1300-bb21-4ae1-8d79-4957f245fc99] @ 2026-09-08T09:36:58.919859+00:00
-> HAS_FACET [node:a1174884-8d33-4260-af5b-0f97264a2ea2] @ 2026-09-08T09:36:58.919859+00:00

Safari 15.0 is the hard compile target for Kitchen Terminal K7, not a preference: the iPad Air 2 (A1567) and the iPhone 6s both stop at iOS/iPadOS 15, so 15.0 is the shared floor for tsconfig and Vite build.target. color-mix() (16.2), oklch() in output CSS (15.4), @container (16.0), :has() (15.4), subgrid (16.0), dvh/svh/lvh (15.4) and text-wrap:balance (17.5) must not ship; backdrop-filter needs -webkit-, :focus-visible needs a :focus fallback, and 100vh is wrong in standalone PWA mode.
---
