archived: false
-> HAS_FACET [node:4c740d82-541d-4c70-9970-793467c4f26e] @ 2026-09-08T09:38:00.686003+00:00

The backend is hexagonal - ports and adapters with dependency injection - which is what lets the UI, the persistence layer and every external integration be swapped behind a port instead of being wired into the application core.
---
