-> HAS_FACET [node:c62c070b-e4a6-41b3-86f3-00ad5d96800f] @ 2026-09-08T09:55:56.019321+00:00

Work state lives in GitHub Issues on the owner's personal account, at mt3o/kitchen-terminal-k7, with plain Issues rather than a Projects board and with closing reserved to a human - the workflow may move, comment on and report divergence against an issue, never close it. Knowledge still goes in the graph: a decision recorded only in an issue comment is a decision no future recall will serve, so the issue gets a pointer at most.
---
[node:75d638bb-1ad3-4938-8b53-cac939b73ac0]
type: decision
